///
/// ```
/// error: possible invariant collision
///   |
///   |   open_local_invariant!(&inv => id1 => {
///   |                           ^ this invariant
///   |       open_local_invariant!(&inv => id2 => {
///   |                               ^ might be the same as this invariant
///   ...
///   |       }
///   |   }
/// ```
